sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Local operator
    participant API as Mission API / coordinator
    participant DB as FalkorDB ops graph
    participant Auth as Deterministic authorizer
    participant Sim as MuJoCo service + journal
    participant Sense as S0 sensors / outcome verifier

    Note over Op,Sim: SC-001 is opt-in and local. The model/corpus lane is disabled and cannot authorize motion.
    Op->>API: Run with stable event ID
    API->>DB: Reserve intent before native work
    DB-->>API: Same intent retained / new request reserved
    API->>DB: Claim task + resource, install fences, read current versions
    API->>DB: Validate source-backed governance snapshot
    DB-->>API: Complete witness + versions + ordered outbox state
    API->>Auth: Exact proposal + claim + evidence + policy snapshot
    Auth->>Auth: Check scope, release, freshness, versions and required predicates
    alt Not authorized or evidence unknown/stale
        Auth-->>API: DENY / NEEDS_APPROVAL / NEEDS_EVIDENCE / STALE
        API-->>Op: No dispatch, retain reason, HOLD if execution uncertainty exists
    else Exact proposal allowed
        Auth-->>API: Immutable ALLOW receipt bound to exact payload and versions
        API->>DB: Atomic intent + dispatch event at next sequence
        DB-->>API: Durable sequence / event identity
        API->>Sim: Typed hash-bound event in order
        Sim->>Sim: Journal identity, fence, epoch and sequence before running
        Sim-->>API: Applied receipt (not physical outcome)
        Sim->>Sim: Advance bounded native controller on one world clock
        Sim->>Sense: Project fresh scoped observations and measured effects
        Sense-->>API: Evidence-backed postconditions or unresolved result
        alt Postconditions verified
            API->>DB: Retain observations + atomically mark task outcome verified
            DB-->>API: Verified task and current graph versions
            API-->>Op: Outcome verified, continue dependency DAG
        else Timeout, mismatch, gap or unknown effect
            API->>Sim: Latch admissions HOLD, do not resend motion
            Sim-->>API: HOLD / UNKNOWN with last known state and reason
            API->>DB: Retain unresolved reconciliation state
            API-->>Op: Stop new work, inspect exact event/receipt and reconcile explicitly
        end
    end

    Note over Op,Sim: Controller completion, applied event receipt, source hash and graph ALLOW are each weaker than a verified physical postcondition.
